@subsection Burgermistress Statement: IF-THEN-ELSE

@cindex Burgermistress IF statement

The IF-THEN-ELSE statement provides conditional execution.

@strong{Syntax}:
@example
IF condition THEN
  statements
ELSE IF condition THEN
  statements
ELSE
  statements
END IF
@end example

@strong{Example 1: Simple IF**:
@example
IF Health > 0 THEN
  Print "You are alive"
END IF
@end example

@strong{Example 2: IF-ELSE**:
@example
IF Health > 0 THEN
  Print "Alive"
ELSE
  Print "Dead"
END IF
@end example

@strong{Example 3: IF-ELSE IF-ELSE**:
@example
IF Health < 25 THEN
  Print "Critical"
ELSE IF Health < 50 THEN
  Print "Wounded"
ELSE
  Print "Healthy"
END IF
@end example

@strong{Example 4: Nested IF**:
@example
IF PlayerAlive THEN
  IF HasWeapon THEN
    Print "Ready to fight"
  ELSE
    Print "Unarmed"
  END IF
END IF
@end example

@strong{Example 5: Complex Condition**:
@example
IF Health > 50 AND Mana > 20 AND Status = ACTIVE THEN
  CastSpell("Fireball")
ELSE IF Health > 20 THEN
  CastSpell("Heal")
ELSE
  Flee()
END IF
@end example

@strong{Domain-Specific Features}:
IF statements in Burgermistress support arbitrary expression conditions. The compiler
optimizes IF to conditional branches with automatic jump-to-false patterns. Short-circuit
evaluation of AND/OR conditions improves performance.

