@subsection Burgermistress Statement: INPUT

@cindex Burgermistress INPUT

The INPUT statement reads player input.

@strong{Syntax}:
@example
INPUT VariableName
INPUT "prompt"; VariableName
@end example

@strong{Example 1: Simple Input**:
@example
